<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/photos/Gemini_Generated_Image.png" type="image/png">
  <title>Messagerie Prestalia</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/recherche.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include("/header") %>
  <main>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-header" style="margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <h1>Messagerie</h1>
          <p>Conversations entre clients et prestataires</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="main-layout" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr; gap: 24px;">
        <aside class="chat-sidebar" style="background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);">
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 0;">Conversations</h2>
            <button style="background: #2563eb; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; cursor: pointer;">Nouveau</button>
          </div>
          <div class="conversation-list" style="display: grid; gap: 12px;">
            <a href="#" class="conversation-item" style="display: block; padding: 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: #f8fafc; text-decoration: none; color: #0f172a;">
              <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;">
                <span><strong>Jean Dupont</strong></span>
                <small style="color:#64748b;">14:32</small>
              </div>
              <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #475569; font-size: 14px;">Demande de devis pour une fuite d'eau</p>
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="conversation-item" style="display: block; padding: 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); text-decoration: none; color: #0f172a;">
              <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;">
                <span><strong>Thomas Bernard</strong></span>
                <small style="color:#64748b;">13:05</small>
              </div>
              <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #475569; font-size: 14px;">Précisions sur l'installation informatique</p>
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="conversation-item" style="display: block; padding: 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: #f8fafc; text-decoration: none; color: #0f172a;">
              <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;">
                <span><strong>Marie L.</strong></span>
                <small style="color:#64748b;">11:20</small>
              </div>
              <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #475569; font-size: 14px;">Confirmation du rendez-vous</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </aside>
        <section class="chat-panel" style="background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <header style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div>
              <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0;">Conversation avec Jean Dupont</h2>
              <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px;">Client • Plombier</p>
            </div>
            <button style="background: transparent; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px 12px; color: #334155; cursor: pointer;"><i class="fas fa-phone" style="margin-right: 8px;"></i>Appeler</button>
          </header>
          <div class="messages" style="flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; display: grid; gap: 14px; padding-right: 8px;">
            <div style="align-self: flex-start; max-width: 80%; background: #f8fafc; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 18px 18px 18px 4px;">
              <p style="margin:0; color: #0f172a;">Bonjour Jean, nous avons reçu votre demande. Pouvez-vous m'envoyer plus de détails sur la fuite ?</p>
              <small style="display:block; margin-top: 8px; color:#64748b; font-size:12px;">Vous • 14:30</small>
            </div>
            <div style="align-self: flex-end; max-width: 80%; background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 18px 18px 4px 18px;">
              <p style="margin:0;">Oui, c'est sous l'évier de la cuisine. L'eau coule en continu.</p>
              <small style="display:block; margin-top: 8px; opacity:0.9; font-size:12px;">Jean • 14:32</small>
            </div>
            <div style="align-self: flex-start; max-width: 80%; background: #f8fafc; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 18px 18px 18px 4px;">
              <p style="margin:0; color: #0f172a;">Merci, je vais préparer un devis et vous reviens rapidement.</p>
              <small style="display:block; margin-top: 8px; color:#64748b; font-size:12px;">Vous • 14:33</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <form style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Écrire un message..." style="flex:1; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #0f172a;">
            <button type="submit" style="background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 18px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i>Envoyer</button>
          </form>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include("/footer") %>
</body>
</html>